        <p>stand. Mrs. J. Sharp, cups and saucers. Mrs. Beswick (Daresbury), vegetable dish. Miss Doan (Daresbury), set of jugs. Auntie Annie (Liverpool), silver salts. A Friend, teapot. Mrs. Jones, d'oyleys. Miss Richards, oil painting.</p>
