        <p>friendly Society Men Meet In Friendly</p>
        <p>Rivalry.</p>
        <p>The eighth annual bowling handicap in con- nection with the " Constitution " Lodge (War- rington District) of the Manchester Unity of the Independent Order of Oddrellows, was brought off on Saturday afternoon on the green attached to the King and Queen Hotel, Padgate-lane. The handicap attracted a good ontrw, and the, Anal, between T. E. James and Pennington was of a most exciting and keenly emitested character, the first named running out winner by a bare point. The afternoon's results were:</p>
