        <p>COUNTY AMATEUR CLUB CHAMPIONSHIP.</p>
        <p>Warrington Club Knocked Out In Third Round.</p>
        <p>The Bull's Head (Warrington) Bowling Club made their exit from the Club Championship contest in connection with the Lanca- shire County Amateur Bowling Associa- tion on Saturday, when, on the ground of the Wigan Subscription Club, they were worsted by.the Stanley Arms (Liverpool) Bowl- ing Club. The Warrington club had made their way into the third round before receiving their conge and they were only beaten by the narrow margin of 'l6 points after a well-contested, and interesting game. Detailed scores :</p>
