        <head>LANCE-CORPORAL F. SMITH,</head>
        <p>LANCE-CORPORAL F. SMITH,</p>
        <p>an employe of Messrs.. Armitage and Rigby's (as overlooker) and an attendant at .Biickley- street Mission, is in the Royal Munster Fusi- liers. Writing from the Front, he says:— "We had another ' smash up' yesterday. We were in the firing trench and the Germans be- gan to send home of their explosiye (high) shells into our support trenches, one of them</p>
