      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-07-24_WidnesExaminer_art0267" n="art0267">
        <head>PRIVATE JOHN SMITH</head>
        <p>PRIVATE JOHN SMITH</p>
        <p>was secretary of the St. John's Club and was a leading hand in sporting circles in the town. He is the oldest of a family of-eleven and one of the three eligible to enlist. He was em- ployed at Messrs. Richmond's. Private Smith met with an accident in the A.S.C. and</p>
