        <p>This week-end's-;;:o;;;;;;; is thoioughll to the high level which experience has taugtil' patrons a this popular house to:, expect. Tile' films are pleasingly diversified in character: and there is something to suit every taste. F°.ir next week the management are repeating their highly successful experiment—first tried a ffir weeks ago—of changing the "star" films most nightly. nightly. Thus on Monday "The Eagle!' Mate" will be the big attraction, on Tuestlii.i "Behind the Scenes," on Wednesday ",n tress Nell," on Thursday and Friday ~c,. a Little Queen," and on Saturday "Cillue"--- ella."</p>
