        <p>Deaths. WOOD.—On the 18th of July, at 47, London-road, Stockton Heath, John Richard, the beloved hus- band of Alice Wood, aged 48 years. Interred at St. Thomas' Church, Stockton Heath. GRIFFITHS.—JuIy 19th, at 22, Marsh-street, Daniel Griffiths, aged 75 years. PATTEN.—JuIy 20th, at 44, John-street, Ann Patten, aged 69 years. ELLIOTT.—JuIy 21st, at 29, Hume-etreet, John Elliott, aged 77 years_ DOBSON.—JuIy 22nd, at 130, Cheater-road, Annie Dobson, aged 64 years.</p>
