        <p>WAR ITEMS. MORE AMBULANCE MEN FOR ACTIVE SERVICE. Four more of the Warrington Corps of the St. John Ambulance Brigade left on Monday for duty in the Military Hospital at Chester. They are:— Private G. IT. Grimshaw, from C.L.C. Wagon Works. Private llorace R. Blease, from Messrs. H. Milling and Co. Private William Bailey, from Messrs. U. Milling and Co. Private Albert Manssuer, from Mr. Ralph Johnson's.</p>
